<div data-cgap-sector="Laboratories, Biotech &amp; Pharma" data-cgap-term="laboratory"></div><p class="lead">Labs need instructions posted at the instrument, not buried in an SOP binder: balance the rotor before running the centrifuge, let the autoclave vent before opening, watch for oxygen displacement around liquid helium, and secure every gas cylinder.</p><p>This collection covers centrifuges, freeze dryers, autoclaves, compressed gas systems, reagents, bioreactors, ultra-low freezers and production equipment in pharma and biotech. Aluminum signs wipe clean and do not curl like paper postings.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Laboratory centrifuge</h3><p>44 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the front rim of the floor-standing centrifuge at hand height beside the lid.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-floor-centrifuge-lid-sign-cgap-c01038-812">Floor Centrifuge Lid</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-centrifuge-out-of-service-tag-sign-cgap-n02723-812">Centrifuge Out Of Service Tag</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-benchtop-centrifuge-lid-sign-cgap-c01173-812">Benchtop Centrifuge Lid</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-centrifuge-rotor-lifting-sign-cgap-c01308-812">Centrifuge Rotor Lifting</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Freeze dryer (lyophilizer)</h3><p>42 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the floor stand at the vacuum hose between pump and chamber.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-freeze-dryer-vacuum-line-sign-cgap-c10128-812">Freeze Dryer Vacuum Line</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-freeze-dryer-vacuum-hose-fitting-sign-cgap-c10263-812">Freeze Dryer Vacuum Hose Fitting</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-manifold-freeze-dryer-ports-sign-cgap-c10398-812">Manifold Freeze Dryer Ports</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-manifold-freeze-dryer-sign-cgap-c10533-812">Manifold Freeze Dryer</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Compressed gas system</h3><p>32 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the handle of the cylinder hand truck parked at the gas room.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gas-cylinder-cart-sign-cgap-c15168-812">Gas Cylinder Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gas-cylinder-cart-ramp-sign-cgap-c15302-812">Gas Cylinder Cart Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-gas-cylinder-storage-cage-sign-cgap-c15436-812">Gas Cylinder Storage Cage</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cylinder-restraint-chain-sign-cgap-c15570-812">Cylinder Restraint Chain</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Laboratory and process reagent</h3><p>22 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Chemical stockroom shelf or the fume hood where it is used.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-oxalyl-chloride-releases-carbon-monoxide-and-sign-8x12-aluminum">Oxalyl Chloride</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-dast-fluorinating-reagent-sign-8x12-aluminum">DAST Fluorinating Reagent</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-sodium-cyanoborohydride-sign-8x12-aluminum">Sodium Cyanoborohydride</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-mcpba-peroxyacid-sign-8x12-aluminum">MCPBA Peroxyacid</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Laboratory autoclave</h3><p>21 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the autoclave front panel beside the chamber door at eye level.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-autoclave-chamber-door-sign-cgap-c01039-812">Autoclave Chamber Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-autoclave-chamber-door-sign-cgap-n01039-812">Autoclave Chamber Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-autoclave-unloading-side-sign-cgap-c01174-812">Autoclave Unloading Side</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-autoclave-steam-vent-plume-sign-cgap-c01309-812">Autoclave Steam Vent Plume</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Autoclave</h3><p>13 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the autoclave front panel beside the door handle.</p><ul><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-lab-autoclave-door-sign-cgap-w00164-812">Lab Autoclave Door</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-liquid-cycle-loading-sign-cgap-i02184-812">Liquid Cycle Loading</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-liquid-cycle-autoclave-sign-cgap-i02319-812">Liquid Cycle Autoclave</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-liquid-load-secondary-pan-sign-cgap-i02454-812">Liquid Load Secondary Pan</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Production lyophilizer</h3><p>7 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or door frame beside the lyophilizer chamber door.</p><ul><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-chamber-cleaning-sign-cgap-i11408-812">Chamber Cleaning</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-lyophilizer-sign-cgap-i08378-812">Lyophilizer</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-lyophilizer-loading-sign-cgap-i08513-812">Lyophilizer Loading</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-lyophilizer-chamber-sign-cgap-i08648-812">Lyophilizer Chamber</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Ultra-low temperature freezer</h3><p>6 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the door handle of the freezer.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ultra-low-freezer-door-handle-sign-cgap-c06087-812">Ultra-Low Freezer Door Handle</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ult-freezer-door-sign-cgap-n06222-812">ULT Freezer Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ultra-low-freezer-latch-sign-cgap-c06222-812">Ultra-Low Freezer Latch</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ultra-low-freezer-shelves-sign-cgap-c06357-812">Ultra-Low Freezer Shelves</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Do you have compressed gas and cryogen signs?</summary><p>Yes, for gas manifolds, cylinder storage and liquid helium. Search &quot;compressed gas&quot; or &quot;liquid helium&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for autoclaves and centrifuges?</summary><p>Yes, including operating steps and hazard warnings at the instrument. Search the instrument name.</p></details><details><summary>Can signs be used in cleanrooms?</summary><p>They are aluminum and wipe clean, but check your own cleanroom material rules before posting.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have compressed gas and cryogen signs?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, for gas manifolds, cylinder storage and liquid helium. Search \"compressed gas\" or \"liquid helium\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for autoclaves and centrifuges?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, i